---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use | Type One Den"
  description="Read the terms of use for Type One Den, including the important medical disclaimer."
>
  <main class="bg-[#0F0F0F] py-16 text-[#F5F5F5]" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">
    <div class="max-w-[720px] mx-auto px-4 space-y-8">
      <header class="space-y-4">
        <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#F472B6]">Terms of Use</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">Terms for using Type One Den</h1>
        <p class="leading-8 text-[#999999]">By accessing or using typeoneden.com, you agree to these Terms of Use. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.</p>
      </header>

      <section class="space-y-4 rounded-3xl border border-[#F472B6] bg-[#1A1A1A] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">Important medical disclaimer</h2>
        <p class="leading-8 text-[#999999]">All content on Type One Den is provided for informational and educational purposes only. Nothing on this website, in emails, in comments, or in videos is intended to be medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. Always seek the advice of your physician, endocrinologist, diabetes educator, or another qualified healthcare professional regarding any medical condition or treatment decision. Never disregard professional medical advice or delay seeking it because of something you read on this site.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 rounded-3xl border border-[#2E2E2E] bg-[#1A1A1A] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">Content ownership</h2>
        <p class="leading-8 text-[#999999]">Unless otherwise stated, all content on Type One Den, including text, graphics, branding, videos, layouts, and original downloads, is owned by Type One Den or used with permission and is protected by applicable intellectual property laws. You may view and share links to the content for personal, non-commercial use, but you may not reproduce, republish, sell, or distribute site content without prior written permission.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 rounded-3xl border border-[#2E2E2E] bg-[#1A1A1A] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">User conduct</h2>
        <p class="leading-8 text-[#999999]">You agree not to use the site in any way that is unlawful, abusive, fraudulent, or disruptive to the operation of the site. You also agree not to attempt to gain unauthorized access to the site, its servers, or related systems.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 rounded-3xl border border-[#2E2E2E] bg-[#1A1A1A] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">Third-party links and services</h2>
        <p class="leading-8 text-[#999999]">This site may contain links to third-party websites, embedded tools, comments platforms, social media services, and affiliate offers. Type One Den is not responsible for the content, policies, accuracy, or practices of third-party services. Your use of any third-party site is at your own risk and subject to that service&apos;s own terms and policies.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 rounded-3xl border border-[#2E2E2E] bg-[#1A1A1A] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p class="leading-8 text-[#999999]">To the fullest extent permitted by law, Type One Den and its owners, contributors, and affiliates will not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, special, or punitive damages arising out of or related to your use of the site, reliance on site content, inability to access the site, or interactions with third-party products or services.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 rounded-3xl border border-[#2E2E2E] bg-[#1A1A1A] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">No warranties</h2>
        <p class="leading-8 text-[#999999]">The site is provided on an &ldquo;as is&rdquo; and &ldquo;as available&rdquo; basis without warranties of any kind, express or implied, including any warranties of accuracy, fitness for a particular purpose, merchantability, or non-infringement.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 rounded-3xl border border-[#2E2E2E] bg-[#1A1A1A] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">Governing law</h2>
        <p class="leading-8 text-[#999999]">These Terms are governed by the laws of the applicable jurisdiction where the owner of Type One Den is based, without regard to conflict of law principles. This is a placeholder governing law clause and should be updated with the correct state or country before launch.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 rounded-3xl border border-[#2E2E2E] bg-[#1A1A1A] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">Contact</h2>
        <p class="leading-8 text-[#999999]">Questions about these Terms can be sent to <a href="mailto:hello@typeoneden.com" class="text-[#F472B6] underline decoration-transparent underline-offset-4 transition hover:decoration-current">hello@typeoneden.com</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
